      en: ["The first mention of the Lords of Clervaux dates back to the year 1129.", "The castle was set on fire on December 17, 1944, during the Battle of the Bulge.", "The Family of Man exhibition consists of 503 photographs by 273 artists.", "Edward Steichen donated his famous collection to Luxembourg in 1964.", "UNESCO added the exhibition to the Memory of the World register in 2003.", "The Luxembourgish state purchased the castle in the 1970s to complete its restoration."],
