      en: ["The castle was built in the 11th century on a 150-meter-long rocky promontory.", "In 1565, the entire complex was almost completely destroyed by a fire.", "The Créhange House was extensively restored between 1983 and 1987.", "Five different noble families lived simultaneously in various parts of the castle.", "The state of Luxembourg acquired the ruins in 1979.", "The castle is strategically located in the heart of the Müllerthal region, also known as Little Switzerland."],
