      en: ["The foundation stone of the current abbey was laid in 1606.", "St. John's Church in the Grund district is part of the original abbey complex.", "From 1867, the abbey served as the country's central prison facility.", "The famous sculptor Lucien Wercollier was imprisoned here during World War II.", "The official reopening as a cultural exchange center took place in May 2004.", "The abbey is situated in a picturesque location along a bend of the Alzette River."],
