      en: ["The castle was destroyed in 1552 by the troops of the French king.", "The hill is located at an altitude of 417 meters above sea level.", "Archaeologists found ceramic shards from the Hallstatt period on the site.", "The current chapel was built in the 18th century on older foundations.", "The wooden observation tower offers views reaching into the Lorraine plain.", "The site has been documented as a pilgrimage destination since the 15th century."],
