      en: ["The museum was officially inaugurated on July 22, 1956.", "It houses artworks by renowned artists such as Lucien Wercollier and Claus Cito.", "The 1942 general strike against the German Wehrmacht is a core theme.", "The museum reopened in 2024 following a multi-year expansion phase.", "Over 500 original documents shed light on daily life under the occupation.", "The building was designed by the well-known architect Nicolas Schmit-Noesen."],
