      en: ["Roman villa architecture", "Foundation walls visible", "Ancient standard of living", "Archaeologically explored"],
      es: ["Arquitectura de villa romana", "Cimientos visibles", "Nivel de vida antiguo", "Investigado arqueológicamente"],
